No functional or compatibility changes; mostly comments.

- mark a few dozen functions and data structures as 0.9.3, out of around 100 initially, with about half remaining;
- fix TRACE-level compiling;
- stop downloading 0.9.2 test vectors; and
- update cosmetic/display spec versions in test suite

These are/were tech debt.

```
NUM_VALIDATORS=${VALIDATORS:-192}
NUM_VALIDATORS=${VALIDATORS:-128}
```
Is to keep `make eth2_network_simulation` working a little better, pending a real fix.

